height and aero.\\nOther parameters are auto-calculated within standard game limits.\",\r\n\r\n  \"DisciplineRoad\": \"Road Racing\",\r\n  \"DisciplineTouge\": \"Touge\",\r\n  \"DisciplineRally\": \"Rally\",\r\n  \"DisciplineCrossCountry\": \"Cross Country\",\r\n  \"DisciplineDrift\": \"Drift\",\r\n  \"DisciplineDrag\": \"Drag\",\r\n  \"DisciplineStreet\": \"Street\",\r\n  \"Enum_Discipline_Road\": \"Road Racing\",\r\n  \"Enum_Discipline_Touge\": \"Touge\",\r\n  \"Enum_Discipline_Rally\": \"Rally\",\r\n  \"Enum_Discipline_CrossCountry\": \"Cross Country\",\r\n  \"Enum_Discipline_Drift\": \"Drift\",\r\n  \"Enum_Discipline_Drag\": \"Drag\",\r\n  \"Enum_Discipline_Street\": \"Street\",\r\n\r\n  \"DisciplineRoadTooltip\": \"Road Racing — tarmac tracks, focus on handling and corner speed.\",\r\n  \"DisciplineTougeTooltip\": \"Touge — mountain pass, requires precise corner entry and stability.\",\r\n  \"DisciplineRallyTooltip\": \"Rally — mixed surface, soft suspension and predictable behavior.\",\r\n  \"DisciplineCrossCountryTooltip\": \"Cross Country — full off-road, max suspension travel and durability.\",\r\n  \"DisciplineDriftTooltip\": \"Drift — controlled oversteer, focus on angle and slip control.\",\r\n  \"DisciplineDragTooltip\": \"Drag Racing — straight-line, maximum weight transfer at launch.\",\r\n  \"DisciplineStreetTooltip\": \"Street Racing — urban tracks with civilian traffic. Speed and maneuverability.\",\r\n\r\n  \"SectionSeason\": \"SEASON\",\r\n  \"SeasonSummerTooltip\": \"Summer — dry hot tarmac, maximum grip. Standard baseline setup.\",\r\n  \"SeasonSpringTooltip\": \"Spring — wet roads from cherry blossom rain, moderate grip reduction.\",\r\n  \"SeasonAutumnTooltip\": \"Autumn — heavy rain, wet roads, longer braking distances. Softer setup.\",\r\n  \"SeasonWinterTooltip\": \"Winter — cold tarmac, slow tire warm-up, icy mountain roads. Most grip reduction.\",\r\n  \"Enum_Season_Summer\": \"Summer\",\r\n  \"Enum_Season_Spring\": \"Spring\",\r\n  \"Enum_Season_Autumn\": \"Autumn\",\r\n  \"Enum_Season_Winter\": \"Winter\",\r\n\r\n  \"DragDistQuarter\": \"¼ mile\",\r\n  \"DragDistHalf\": \"½ mile\",\r\n  \"DragDistMile\": \"1 mile\",\r\n\r\n  \"UnitToggleLabel\": \"Units:\",\r\n  \"UnitMetricLabel\": \"\uD83D\uDCD0 Metric\",\r\n  \"UnitImperialLabel\": \"\uD83D\uDCD0 Imperial\",\r\n  \"UnitTooltip\": \"Metric / Imperial system\",\r\n  \"PowerUnitTooltip\": \"HP / PS / kW\",\r\n  \"SpringUnitTooltip\": \"kgf/mm / N/mm / lb/in\",\r\n\r\n  \"ProfilesLabel\": \"Profiles:\",\r\n  \"ProfileSave\": \"\uD83D\uDCBE Save\",\r\n  \"ProfileLoad\": \"Load\",\r\n  \"ProfileDelete\": \"\uD83D\uDDD1 Delete\",\r\n  \"ProfileDeleteAll\": \"\uD83D\uDDD1 Delete All\",\r\n  \"DeleteAllProfilesConfirm\": \"Delete ALL profiles? This cannot be undone.\",\r\n  \"DeleteAllProfilesTitle\": \"Confirm\",\r\n  \"StatusAllProfilesDeleted\": \"All profiles deleted\",\r\n  \"ProfileNew\": \"+ New\",\r\n  \"StatusProfilesRecalculated\": \"Recalculated outdated profiles: {0}\",\r\n\r\n  \"MainTitle\": \"Forza Horizon 6 Tune Master\",\r\n  \"HelpSymbol\": \"?\",\r\n  \"HelpButtonTooltip\": \"How to use Tune Master\",\r\n  \"VersionButtonTooltip\": \"What\\u0027s new\",\r\n  \"GenerateButton\": \"⚡  Generate\",\r\n  \"AutoCheckbox\": \"✓ Auto\",\r\n  \"OverlayCheckbox\": \"Overlay\",\r\n  \"OverlayOpacityTooltip\": \"Overlay opacity\",\r\n  \"StatusBarDefault\": \"Ready\",\r\n  \"EmptyStateTitle\": \"\uD83C\uDFCE\",\r\n  \"EmptyStateText\": \"Tune not yet generated\",\r\n  \"EmptyStateHint\": \"Pick a car and a discipline — the tune is calculated automatically\",\r\n\r\n  \"ResultHeader\": \"⚡ TUNE\",\r\n  \"ResultCreatedFormat\": \"Generated: {0:dd.MM.yyyy  HH:mm}\",\r\n  \"ResultCreatedHeader\": \"Generated:\",\r\n\r\n  \"ResultTirePressure\": \"TIRE PRESSURE\",\r\n  \"ResultTirePressureFront\": \"FRONT\",\r\n  \"ResultTirePressureRear\": \"REAR\",\r\n  \"ResultGeometry\": \"WHEEL ALIGNMENT\",\r\n  \"ResultCamberFront\": \"CAMBER F\",\r\n  \"ResultCamberRear\": \"CAMBER R\",\r\n  \"ResultCaster\": \"CASTER\",\r\n  \"ResultToeFront\": \"TOE F\",\r\n  \"ResultToeRear\": \"TOE R\",\r\n  \"ResultARB\": \"ANTI-ROLL BARS\",\r\n  \"ResultARBFront\": \"FRONT\",\r\n  \"ResultARBRear\": \"REAR\",\r\n  \"ResultSprings\": \"SPRINGS\",\r\n  \"ResultSpringFront\": \"FRONT\",\r\n  \"ResultSpringRear\": \"REAR\",\r\n  \"ResultRideHeight\": \"RIDE HEIGHT\",\r\n  \"ResultRideHeightFront\": \"FRONT\",\r\n  \"ResultRideHeightRear\": \"REAR\",\r\n  \"ResultDampers\": \"DAMPERS (1–20)\",\r\n  \"ResultReboundFront\": \"REBOUND F\",\r\n  \"ResultReboundRear\": \"REBOUND R\",\r\n  \"ResultBumpFront\": \"BUMP F\",\r\n  \"ResultBumpRear\": \"BUMP R\",\r\n  \"ResultAero\": \"AERODYNAMICS\",\r\n  \"ResultAeroFront\": \"FRONT\",\r\n  \"ResultAeroRear\": \"REAR\",\r\n  \"ResultDiff\": \"DIFFERENTIAL (%)\",\r\n  \"ResultDiffRear\": \"Rear / Main\",\r\n  \"ResultDiffAccel\": \"ACCEL\",\r\n  \"ResultDiffDecel\": \"DECEL\",\r\n  \"ResultDiffCenter\": \"CENTRE DIFF (AWD)\",\r\n  \"ResultDiffCenterBias\": \"CENTER BIAS\",\r\n  \"ResultDiffFront\": \"Front (AWD)\",\r\n  \"ResultDiffSuffixFront\": \"front\",\r\n  \"ResultDiffSuffixRear\": \"rear\",\r\n  \"ResultBrakes\": \"BRAKES\",\r\n  \"ResultBrakeBalance\": \"BALANCE F\",\r\n  \"ResultBrakePressure\": \"PRESSURE\",\r\n  \"ResultGearing\": \"GEARING\",\r\n  \"ResultGearChart\": \"Gear chart\",\r\n  \"ResultPowerCurve\": \"Power/torque curve\",\r\n  \"PowerEstimatedMark\": \"≈\",\r\n  \"PowerEstimatedHint\": \"Estimate: the game files have no exact factory data for this swapped engine, so power and torque are approximated from the stock curve.\",\r\n  \"ResultFinalDrive\": \"FINAL DRIVE\",\r\n  \"ResultMaxSpeed\": \"MAX SPEED\",\r\n  \"ResultMaxSpeedTooltip\": \"~ Estimated top speed at current gear ratios and RPM\",\r\n  \"ResultRecGears\": \"REC. GEARS\",\r\n  \"ResultRecGearsHint\": \"Recommended number of gears for this build — computed from the engine's powerband and the speed range it can actually reach. It's advice, not a copy of your installed gearbox, so it may differ. For the most out of the engine, fit a gearbox with this many speeds.\",\r\n  \"ResultForceRecGears\": \"Override ratios & chart with recommended gears\",\r\n  \"ResultSpringsHint\": \"Spring rates are calculated from pure physics with no limits — they may exceed the in-game slider range. The game's limits depend on suspension geometry (motion ratio). Use as a starting point — fine-tune exact values in-game.\",\r\n  \"ResultGearFormat\": \"Gear \",\r\n\r\n  \"LaunchControlHeader\": \"\uD83D\uDEA6 LAUNCH CONTROL\",\r\n  \"LaunchControlLabel\": \"\uD83D\uDEA6 Launch control\",\r\n  \"LaunchControlHint\": \"Optimal launch RPM. Hold throttle at this RPM before the green light.\",\r\n  \"LaunchControlRpm\": \"RPM\",\r\n\r\n  \"HelpWindowTitle\": \"Guide — Tune Master\",\r\n  \"HelpTitle\": \"How to use Tune Master\",\r\n  \"HelpClose\": \"OK — Close\",\r\n  \"HelpDontShowAgain\": \"Don't show on startup\",\r\n  \"HelpProgressLabel\": \"10 steps • Quick guide to Tune Master\",\r\n\r\n  \"FieldPower\": \"Power\",\r\n  \"FieldSpeed\": \"Max speed\",\r\n  \"FieldMass\": \"Total mass\",\r\n  \"FieldTorque\": \"Torque\",\r\n  \"FieldWheelbase\": \"Wheelbase\",\r\n  \"FieldFrontTrack\": \"Front track\",\r\n  \"FieldRearTrack\": \"Rear track\",\r\n  \"FieldMaxRPM\": \"Max RPM\",\r\n\r\n  \"UnitBar\": \"BAR\",\r\n  \"UnitPsi\": \"PSI\",\r\n  \"UnitKgfMm\": \"kgf/mm\",\r\n  \"UnitNmm\": \"N/mm\",\r\n  \"UnitLbsInch\": \"lb/in\",\r\n  \"UnitMm\": \"mm\",\r\n  \"UnitInch\": \"in\",\r\n  \"UnitKmh\": \"km/h\",\r\n  \"UnitMph\": \"mph\",\r\n\r\n  \"SpringUnitKgfMmLabel\": \"Ⓜ kgf/mm\",\r\n  \"SpringUnitNmmLabel\": \"Ⓜ N/mm\",\r\n  \"SpringUnitLbsInLabel\": \"Ⓜ lb/in\",\r\n\r\n  \"CarsLoadingError\": \"Failed to load car list: {0}\",\r\n\r\n  \"LanguageLabel\": \"Language:\",\r\n  \"FontLabel\": \"Font:\",\r\n  \"LanguageRu\": \"Русский\",\r\n  \"LanguageEn\": \"English\",\r\n\r\n  \"HelpStep0Title\": \"0 — DISPLAY SETTINGS\",\r\n\r\n  \"HelpStep0Text\": \"The top bar of the main window contains all display controls — adjust these first for a comfortable experience.\\r\\n\\r\\n• Language: Русский / English — switches the entire interface.\\r\\n• Font «+» / «−» — changes the font size across the whole app (results, charts, part lists). Size is saved and restored on restart.\\r\\n• Units: Metric ↔ Imperial — toggles all displayed values (speeds, pressures, lengths, spring rates).\\r\\n• Power unit: HP / PS / kW — independent from the metric/imperial toggle.\\r\\n• Spring-rate unit: N/mm · kgf/mm · lb/in — displayed on results and charts.\",\r\n\r\n  \"HelpStep0Note\": \"All internal calculations always run in metric (SI) units. Units and language switches only affect the displayed text — the underlying physics are unchanged. Font size, selected units and language are persisted to %APPDATA%\\\\ForzaTuneMaster\\\\settings.json.\",\r\n\r\n  \"HelpStep1Title\": \"1 — CAR SELECTION\",\r\n  \"HelpStep1Text\": \"Top-left, in the 'Car search' box, start typing a make, model or year — the list filters automatically. Pick a car from the dropdown.\\r\\n\\r\\nAll specs (mass, weight distribution, power, torque, RPM, engine, drive type, gear count, wheelbase, tires, etc.) fill in automatically from the built-in game database. The '✕' button clears the selection.\",\r\n  \"HelpStep1Note\": \"The entire car and parts database is bundled with the app and extracted directly from Forza Horizon 6 game files — no internet and no manual spec entry needed. The selected car appears in the header of the results panel on the right.\",\r\n\r\n  \"HelpStep2Title\": \"2 — INSTALL PARTS (JUST LIKE IN-GAME)\",\r\n  \"HelpStep2Text\": \"Below the search box are collapsible upgrade sections — just like the in-game garage. Click a header to expand a section:\\r\\n\\r\\n• Body kits & modifications (swaps)\\r\\n• Engine\\r\\n• Chassis & handling\\r\\n• Drivetrain\\r\\n• Tires & wheels\\r\\n• Aero & appearance\\r\\n\\r\\nEach section offers exactly the parts that exist for the selected car in the game.\",\r\n  \"HelpStep2Note\": \"Part lists are built from the selected car's database; categories that don't apply auto-hide. Changing any part recalculates power, mass, drive type and geometry, and the tune updates automatically.\",\r\n\r\n  \"HelpStep3Title\": \"3 — SWAPS & ENGINE\",\r\n  \"HelpStep3Text\": \"The 'Body kits & modifications' section holds the swaps: engine, drivetrain (FWD/RWD/AWD) and aspiration type — these reshape the whole power map and car behavior.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe 'Engine' section is grouped: valvetrain & bottom end (camshaft, displacement, valves, pistons, flywheel), air/fuel/exhaust (intake, manifold, exhaust, fuel system, intercooler, restrictor) and ignition/cooling.\",\r\n  \"HelpStep3Note\": \"For electric cars the ICE sections hide — a 'Motor & battery' section appears instead, with a motor swap and its upgrades. Hybrids and ICE cars use the engine sections.\",\r\n\r\n  \"HelpStep4Title\": \"4 — CHASSIS, DRIVETRAIN, TIRES, AERO\",\r\n  \"HelpStep4Text\": \"• CHASSIS — springs/dampers, anti-roll bars (front/rear), brakes, chassis stiffness, weight reduction.\\r\\n• DRIVETRAIN — gearbox, clutch, final drive/driveline, differential.\\r\\n• TIRES & WHEELS — tire compound, width and profile (front/rear), wheel style and size, track spacers.\\r\\n• AERO — front bumper, rear wing, rear bumper, side skirts.\",\r\n  \"HelpStep4Note\": \"The level of the installed parts sets the physical tuning bounds: the generator picks values within the range that the chosen parts unlock (e.g. race springs give a wider stiffness and ride-height range).\\r\\n\\r\\n⚠ Wheels (rim style) — approximate: their effect on car mass is estimated from the wheel's lightness tier (an empirical formula), not taken directly from the game. Rim size and tire width are exact. It is a difference of a few kg, so it has a negligible effect on the tuning calculations.\",\r\n\r\n  \"HelpStep5Title\": \"5 — DISCIPLINE & SEASON\",\r\n   \"HelpStep5Text\": \"At the bottom of the results panel (right), choose a discipline — it drives target spring frequencies, wheel geometry, gear ratios, differential and tire pressure:\\r\\n\\r\\n• Road • Touge • Rally • Cross Country • Drift • Drag • Street\\r\\n\\r\\nNext to it, pick a season (Spring / Summer / Autumn / Winter). For Drag, also set the distance (¼, ½ or mile).\",\r\n  \"HelpStep5Note\": \"There is no separate 'Generate' button — the tune recalculates automatically on any change: car selection, a part swap, discipline or season. Season changes the grip factor and adjusts springs, dampers, ARB, differential and tire pressure.\",\r\n\r\n  \"HelpStep6Title\": \"6 — VIEWING RESULTS\",\r\n  \"HelpStep6Text\": \"The right panel shows the finished tune. The colored bar under each value shows where it sits within its allowed range. Results are split into sections:\",\r\n\r\n  \"HelpStep7Title\": \"7 — LAUNCH CONTROL (DRAG)\",\r\n  \"HelpStep7Text\": \"In Drag mode a '\uD83D\uDEA6 LAUNCH CONTROL' block appears above the gears with the optimal launch RPM. Hold the throttle at this RPM before launching.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe calculation accounts for: aspiration type (turbos need pre-spooling), torque-peak RPM (lower peak = lower launch), drive type (AWD can launch at higher RPM) and fuel type (diesel gets lower RPM).\",\r\n\r\n  \"HelpStep8Title\": \"8 — PROFILES & UNITS\",\r\n  \"HelpStep8Text\": \"Profiles save a full build: car, installed parts, discipline/season and the result.\\r\\n\\r\\n• '\uD83D\uDCBE Save' — stores the current build. Name auto-generated: Make_Model_Year_Drive_Discipline.\\r\\n• 'Load' — pick a profile in the list below and it applies instantly.\\r\\n• '\uD83D\uDDD1 Delete' — removes the selected profile.\\r\\n• 'Delete all' — clears the whole profile list.\\r\\n\\r\\nProfiles are stored as JSON in %APPDATA%\\\\ForzaTuneMaster\\\\profiles\\\\ and are recalculated automatically on load when needed.\",\r\n  \"HelpStep8Note\": \"Units and language toggle in the top bar:\\r\\n• Metric / Imperial — affects all unit displays\\r\\n• Power: HP / PS / kW\\r\\n• Spring rate: N/mm · kgf/mm · lb/in\\r\\n• Interface language: Русский / English\\r\\n• «+» / «−» buttons — font size across the whole app (charts included). Size is saved.\\r\\n\\r\\nAll calculations run in metric (SI) units — imperial conversion is for display only.\",\r\n\r\n  \"HelpStep9Title\": \"9 — FLOATING OVERLAY\",\r\n  \"HelpStep9Text\": \"Tune results can be shown in a separate window on top of the game and other apps:\\r\\n\\r\\n• TOGGLE — the 'Overlay' checkbox in the results panel header or Ctrl+Shift+O\\r\\n• DRAG — by the window header\\r\\n• RESIZE — by any corner of the window\\r\\n• OPACITY — slider in the header\\r\\n• CLOSE — the ✕ button in the header or press Ctrl+Shift+O again\\r\\n\\r\\nOverlay position, size and opacity are saved and restored on next open.\\r\\n\\r\\n\uD83D\uDCA1 When you change the car or a part, the overlay charts (just like in the main window) update smoothly: fade-out → redraw → fade-in. Language/unit switches redraw instantly.\",\r\n\r\n  \"ChangelogWindowTitle\": \"What\\u0027s new — Tune Master\",\r\n  \"ChangelogTitle\": \"What\\u0027s new\",\r\n  \"ChangelogClose\": \"OK\",\r\n\r\n  \"ChangelogV0\": \"• BUILT-IN GAME DATABASE. All cars and parts are bundled into the app, extracted from Forza Horizon 6 files. No internet or manual spec entry needed — pick a car and its parameters fill in automatically.\\n\\n• INSTALL PARTS LIKE IN-GAME. Instead of abstract \\\"levels\\\", you fit the actual parts from the car\\u0027s catalog, by section: swaps, engine (or motor for EVs), chassis, drivetrain, tires & wheels, aero.\\n\\n• PHYSICS-BASED CALCULATION. The tune and its allowed ranges are computed from the real parameters of the installed parts in the database. Calculation formulas fixed.\\n\\n• AUTOMATIC GENERATION. No more \\\"Generate\\\" button — the tune recalculates by itself on any change.\\n\\n• NEW DESIGN. Reworked interface, result cards with range indicators, gear and power/torque charts, and an improved floating overlay (Ctrl+Shift+O).\\n\\n• HELP rewritten for the new logic.\",\r\n\r\n  \"Enum_EngineType_I1\": \"I1 (single-cylinder)\",\r\n  \"Enum_EngineType_I2\": \"I2\",\r\n  \"Enum_EngineType_I3\": \"I3\",\r\n  \"Enum_EngineType_I4\": \"I4\",\r\n  \"Enum_EngineType_I5\": \"I5\",\r\n  \"Enum_EngineType_I6\": \"I6 (straight-six)\",\r\n  \"Enum_EngineType_I8\": \"I8 (straight-eight)\",\r\n  \"Enum_EngineType_Boxer\": \"Boxer / Flat\",\r\n  \"Enum_EngineType_V6\": \"V6\",\r\n  \"Enum_EngineType_V8\": \"V8\",\r\n  \"Enum_EngineType_V10\": \"V10\",\r\n  \"Enum_EngineType_V12\": \"V12\",\r\n  \"Enum_EngineType_W12\": \"W12\",\r\n  \"Enum_EngineType_Rotary\": \"Rotary\",\r\n\r\n  \"Enum_EnginePosition_Front\": \"Front\",\r\n  \"Enum_EnginePosition_Mid\": \"Mid\",\r\n  \"Enum_EnginePosition_Rear\": \"Rear\",\r\n\r\n  \"Enum_DriveType_FWD\": \"Front (FWD)\",\r\n  \"Enum_DriveType_RWD\": \"Rear (RWD)\",\r\n  \"Enum_DriveType_AWD\": \"All-Wheel (AWD)\",\r\n\r\n  \"Enum_TireType_Stock\": \"Stock\",\r\n  \"Enum_TireType_Street\": \"Street\",\r\n  \"Enum_TireType_Sport\": \"Sport\",\r\n  \"Enum_TireType_SemiSlick\": \"Semi-Slick\",\r\n  \"Enum_TireType_Slick\": \"Slick\",\r\n  \"Enum_TireType_Rally\": \"Rally\",\r\n  \"Enum_TireType_Offroad\": \"Off-road\",\r\n  \"Enum_TireType_Drag\": \"Drag\",\r\n  \"Enum_TireType_Winter\": \"Winter\",\r\n\r\n  \"Enum_SuspensionUpgrade_Stock\": \"Stock\",\r\n  \"Enum_SuspensionUpgrade_Street\": \"Street\",\r\n  \"Enum_SuspensionUpgrade_Sport\": \"Sport\",\r\n  \"Enum_SuspensionUpgrade_Race\": \"Race\",\r\n  \"Enum_SuspensionUpgrade_Rally\": \"Rally\",\r\n  \"Enum_SuspensionUpgrade_Drift\": \"Drift\",\r\n  \"Enum_SuspensionUpgrade_Offroad\": \"Off-road\",\r\n\r\n  \"Enum_DifferentialUpgrade_Stock\": \"Stock\",\r\n  \"Enum_DifferentialUpgrade_Street\": \"Street\",\r\n  \"Enum_DifferentialUpgrade_Sport\": \"Sport\",\r\n  \"Enum_DifferentialUpgrade_Rally\": \"Rally\",\r\n  \"Enum_DifferentialUpgrade_Race\": \"Race\",\r\n  \"Enum_DifferentialUpgrade_DriftSpec\": \"Drift\",\r\n  \"Enum_DifferentialUpgrade_Offroad\": \"Off-road\",\r\n\r\n  \"Enum_BrakesUpgrade_Stock\": \"Stock\",\r\n  \"Enum_BrakesUpgrade_Street\": \"Street\",\r\n  \"Enum_BrakesUpgrade_Sport\": \"Sport\",\r\n  \"Enum_BrakesUpgrade_Race\": \"Race\",\r\n\r\n  \"Enum_PowertrainType_ICE\": \"ICE (internal combustion)\",\r\n  \"Enum_PowertrainType_Hybrid\": \"Hybrid (ICE + electric motor)\",\r\n  \"Enum_PowertrainType_Electric\": \"Electric (BEV)\",\r\n\r\n  \"Enum_AspirationType_Natural\": \"Naturally aspirated\",\r\n  \"Enum_AspirationType_SingleTurbo\": \"Single turbo\",\r\n  \"Enum_AspirationType_TwinTurbo\": \"Twin turbo\",\r\n  \"Enum_AspirationType_PositiveDisplacement\": \"Positive displacement supercharger\",\r\n  \"Enum_AspirationType_Centrifugal\": \"Centrifugal supercharger\",\r\n  \"Enum_AspirationType_Electric\": \"Electric\",\r\n\r\n  \"FieldPower_HP\": \"Power (HP)\",\r\n  \"FieldPower_PS\": \"Power (PS)\",\r\n  \"FieldPower_KW\": \"Power (kW)\",\r\n  \"FieldSpeed_Metric\": \"Max speed (km/h, calc.)\",\r\n  \"FieldSpeed_Imperial\": \"Max speed (mph, calc.)\",\r\n  \"FieldMass_Metric\": \"Total mass (kg)\",\r\n  \"FieldMass_Imperial\": \"Total mass (lb)\",\r\n  \"FieldTorque_Metric\": \"Torque (Nm)\",\r\n  \"FieldTorque_Imperial\": \"Torque (lb·ft)\",\r\n  \"FieldWheelbase_Metric\": \"Wheelbase (mm)\",\r\n  \"FieldWheelbase_Imperial\": \"Wheelbase (in)\",\r\n  \"FieldFrontTrack_Metric\": \"Front track (mm)\",\r\n  \"FieldFrontTrack_Imperial\": \"Front track (in)\",\r\n  \"FieldRearTrack_Metric\": \"Rear track (mm)\",\r\n  \"FieldRearTrack_Imperial\": \"Rear track (in)\",\r\n  \"FieldMaxRPM_Electric\": \"Motor max RPM\",\r\n  \"FieldMaxRPM_ICE\": \"Max RPM\",\r\n\r\n  \"UnitPressure_Metric\": \"TIRE PRESSURE (BAR)\",\r\n  \"UnitPressure_Imperial\": \"TIRE PRESSURE (PSI)\",\r\n  \"UnitSpring_NMm\": \"SPRINGS (N/MM)\",\r\n  \"UnitSpring_LbsIn\": \"SPRINGS (LB/IN)\",\r\n  \"UnitSpring_KgfMm\": \"SPRINGS (KGF/MM)\",\r\n  \"UnitRideHeight_Metric\": \"RIDE HEIGHT (MM)\",\r\n  \"UnitRideHeight_Imperial\": \"RIDE HEIGHT (IN)\",\r\n\r\n  \"UnitKg\": \"kg\",\r\n  \"UnitLb\": \"lb\",\r\n  \"UnitKw\": \"kW\",\r\n  \"UnitHp\": \"hp\",\r\n  \"UnitPs\": \"PS\",\r\n  \"UnitNm\": \"Nm\",\r\n  \"UnitLbFt\": \"lb·ft\",\r\n  \"UnitRPM\": \"rpm\",\r\n  \"HelpStep6Line1\": \"• TIRE PRESSURE — front/rear. Base from tire compound, adjusted by mass and weight distribution.\",\r\n  \"HelpStep6Line2\": \"• WHEEL ALIGNMENT — camber (discipline + load + aero), caster (mass + speed), toe (drive + discipline + speed).\",\r\n  \"HelpStep6Line3\": \"• ANTI-ROLL BARS (ARB) — front/rear stiffness. From discipline, mass, track, weight distribution and body roll.\",\r\n  \"HelpStep6Line4\": \"• SPRINGS + RIDE HEIGHT — stiffness from target frequency (k = 0.0197 × Hz² × mass × wtDist) within the chosen springs' physics. Height: from discipline and engine position.\",\r\n  \"HelpStep6Line5\": \"• DAMPERS — rebound/bump (1–20). Base from discipline, adjusted for mass, weight dist, drive type and aspiration.\",\r\n  \"HelpStep6Line6\": \"• AERODYNAMICS — front/rear downforce. Depends on drive type, speed and power; solved iteratively. Drift/CC/Rally are reduced.\",\r\n  \"HelpStep6Line7\": \"• DIFFERENTIAL — accel/decel lock. From discipline/drive, power and torque. For AWD — separate front and center diff.\",\r\n  \"HelpStep6Line8\": \"• BRAKES — balance (% front) = weight dist + discipline offset. Pressure: from discipline, mass and speed.\",\r\n  \"HelpStep6Line9\": \"• GEARING — final drive targeting max speed, ratios (geometric progression) with post-validation. First/top gear from discipline.\",\r\n  \"HelpStep6Line10\": \"Hover over any value — the tooltip explains the physics. Below: the gear chart (speed range per gear) with a legend (trajectory, rev limit, max speed) and the power/torque curve. The '!' badge next to springs warns that values may exceed in-game limits. Next to final drive — recommended gear count with a force-recalc checkbox. The checkboxes show/hide the charts. Charts animate smoothly when data changes.\",\r\n  \"CurveAxisTorque\": \"Torque, Nm\",\r\n  \"CurveAxisPower\": \"Power, HP\",\r\n  \"CurveLegendTorque\": \"Torque\",\r\n  \"CurveLegendPower\": \"Power\",\r\n  \"ChartAxisSpeed\": \"Speed\",\r\n  \"ChartAxisRPM\": \"RPM\",\r\n  \"ChartRevLimitLabel\": \"rev limit\",\r\n  \"ChartPowerPeakLabel\": \"Pmax\",\r\n  \"ChartTorquePeakLabel\": \"Mmax\",\r\n  \"ChartPeakAtRpmFmt\": \"@ {0} RPM\",\r\n  \"ChartPeakToleranceHint\": \"Calculated values. May differ slightly from in-game due to curve scaling mechanics and approximation.\",\r\n  \"GearLegendTrajectory\": \"Trajectory\",\r\n  \"GearLegendMaxSpeed\": \"Max speed\",\r\n  \"ProfileDefaultName\": \"New profile\",\r\n\r\n  \"Expl_TirePressure_Fmt\": \"Pressure: F {0:F2} / R {1:F2} bar. {2}\",\r\n  \"Expl_TirePressureReason_Drag\": \"Drag: neutral front (~32 PSI), min rear (~18-20 PSI) for max launch grip.\",\r\n  \"Expl_TirePressureReason_Drift\": \"Drift: ~25 PSI front / ~22 PSI rear for predictable sliding.\",\r\n  \"Expl_TirePressureReason_Rally\": \"Rally/CC: lower pressure for maximum contact patch.\",\r\n  \"Expl_TirePressureReason_CrossCountry\": \"Rally/CC: lower pressure for maximum contact patch.\",\r\n  \"Expl_TirePressureReason_Touge\": \"Touge: slightly softer than base for mountain road grip.\",\r\n  \"Expl_TirePressureReason_Street\": \"Street: standard pressure with slight rear margin for maneuvers.\",\r\n  \"Expl_TirePressureReason_Road\": \"Default pressure for tarmac disciplines.\",\r\n\r\n  \"Expl_Camber_Fmt\": \"Camber: F {0}° / R {1}°. {2}\",\r\n  \"Expl_Camber_Disabled\": \"Camber: tuning unavailable (stock/street/sport suspension).\",\r\n  \"Expl_Camber_Defaults_Fmt\": \"Camber: F {0}° / R {1}° (default values).\", \r\n  \"Expl_CamberReas