-  "ChangelogV0": "• BUILT-IN GAME DATABASE. All cars and parts are bundled into the app, extracted from Forza Horizon 6 files. No internet or manual spec entry needed — pick a car and its parameters fill in automatically.\n\n• INSTALL PARTS LIKE IN-GAME. Instead of abstract \"levels\", you fit the actual parts from the car\u0027s catalog, by section: swaps, engine (or motor for EVs), chassis, drivetrain, tires & wheels, aero.\n\n• PHYSICS-BASED CALCULATION. The tune and its allowed ranges are computed from the real parameters of the installed parts in the database. Calculation formulas fixed.\n\n• AUTOMATIC GENERATION. No more \"Generate\" button — the tune recalculates by itself on any change.\n\n• NEW DESIGN. Reworked interface, result cards with range indicators, gear and power/torque charts, and an improved floating overlay (Ctrl+Shift+O).\n\n• HELP rewritten for the new logic.",
+  "ChangelogV0": "• VERSION 2.1 — a better window, reset buttons, and visual feedback.\n\n• WINDOW FITS ANY SCREEN. The interface is no longer locked to one size — resize freely and everything stays clean. Works great on smaller screens too.\n\n• CATEGORY & FULL RESET. Each part group has a \"✕\" button — click to revert the whole category to stock. \"Reset All\" resets everything at once (with confirmation).\n\n• CHANGED PART HIGHLIGHTING. Replaced parts stand out with an orange border — you always know what\u0027s been tuned.\n\n• REFINED CALCULATIONS. Aero and other formulas have been tweaked for more accurate tunes.",
 
